@startuml
title ACT-12 - Perform AI-Assisted Template Security Review

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    FontColor black
    DiamondBackgroundColor white
    DiamondBorderColor black
}

|Template Publisher|
start
:Submit template issue for security review;

|Validation Engine|
:Validate manifest and schema;
if (Manifest and schema valid?) then (yes)
    :Inspect package dependencies;
    :Inspect assets and references;
    :Check macro and shell-escape restrictions;
else (no)
    :Report manifest validation failure;
    :Block publication workflow;
    stop
endif

|AI Security Review System|
:Perform baseline security analysis;

while (Security findings detected?) is (yes)
    :Classify findings and vulnerability details;
    |GitHub Actions|
    :Post diagnostic scan comment on issue;
    :Apply needs-fixes label;
    |Template Publisher|
    :Review diagnostic findings;
    :Fix vulnerable template elements;
    :Push remediation commits to repository;
    |AI Security Review System|
    :Re-analyze updated template source;
endwhile (no)

|AI Security Review System|
:Mark security review as passed;

|GitHub Actions|
:Apply approved-and-verified label;
:Proceed to catalog publication workflow;
stop
@enduml
